WEBVTT

00:00:01.252 --> 00:00:04.541
On July the nineteenth,
Musgrave, Raynal and Alick

00:00:04.541 --> 00:00:06.866
left Camp Cove on a fair wind.

00:00:06.866 --> 00:00:09.352
Within twenty miles it
had risen to a gale.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.234
Raynal and Alick steered in turns.

00:00:14.234 --> 00:00:17.459
Musgrave pumped one-handed,
clinging to a rope.

00:00:17.459 --> 00:00:20.628
Nearly half their time went into
simply riding out the storm.

